{"kind":"reasoning","id":"p2-0585ef77","text":"Reviewing search results for tax references, confirming dashboard lacks them, and deciding to drop tax from total calculation.Selecting plain text for the receipt format and keeping tax columns in the backend for historical compatibility.","open":false,"collapse":"preview"}
Mapping complete. One important consequence first: the current QR is a **ZATCA e-invoicing QR** (legally required on Saudi tax invoices). Replacing it with a plain business-name/items/price QR means receipts will **no longer be ZATCA-compliant** — I'm treating that as your intent since you asked to drop the tax number entirely.

## Plan

**Totals logic (no tax anywhere):** `total = subtotal − discount`. Discount stays; only tax goes.

**Frontend**
- [models](src/app/core/models/invoice.model.ts) — remove `taxRate`/`taxAmount` from `Invoice`; remove `taxId`/`taxRate` from `Settings` + `DEFAULT_SETTINGS` in [settings.model.ts](src/app/core/models/settings.model.ts).
- [Settings page](src/app/features/settings/settings.ts) — drop the tax-ID and tax-rate inputs from `formData` and [settings.html](src/app/features/settings/settings.html).
- [Sale flow](src/app/core/services/invoice.service.ts) — `completeSale()` computes `total = subtotal − discount`, no tax fields sent.
- [POS](src/app/features/pos/pos.ts) — remove `taxAmount` computed; `finalTotal = subtotal − discount`; strip tax/tax-ID rows from [pos.html](src/app/features/pos/pos.html) (screen receipt + print receipt).
- [Invoice detail](src/app/features/invoices/invoice-detail.ts) — strip tax rows + tax-ID line from [invoice-detail.html](src/app/features/invoices/invoice-detail.html) (screen + print).
- **QR rewrite** — replace [zatca-qr.ts](src/app/core/utils/zatca-qr.ts) TLV encoder with a plain-text builder, e.g.:
  ```
  shopName
  item name ×qty — line total
  ...
  الإجمالي: total ر.س
  ```
  Both `pos.ts` (`renderQrForPrint`) and `invoice-detail.ts` (`generateQr`) use it; scannable by any camera, human-readable.

**Backend + DB** — keep `taxRate`/`taxAmount`/`taxId` columns in [db.js](db.js) (old invoices keep their history intact); [server.js](server.js) defaults them to `0`/`''` on new invoices. Remove the keys from [data/settings.json](data/settings.json).

**Verify** — `ng build`, boot server, complete a test sale, decode the QR payload, confirm no tax lines on screen/print/settings, then clean up test data.

Approving this plan switches the thread to build mode and queues the implementation.

